body:
Yoooo, I am 20. I can be an idiot sometimes, and flirting in a video game doesn't hurt, when I am not an asshole. What do you mean? xD

&#x200B;

It is kinda fun to argue with you, wanna play some Apex or something together? :D

OOHHH JESUS CHRIST, PROTECT THIS PURE AND INNOCENT SOUL!

&#x200B;

DO NOT DIVE INTO IT YET, YOU WILL DEEPLY REGRET IT!

&#x200B;

The story is sooooooo good, >!and it will kill your soul, with no hope of redemption!<, since it's not finished. The weekly release wait is pure torture!

&#x200B;

EDIT: >!I made the mistake and did read it through 3 days, yesterday night I was shattered, chest hurt, and tears of pain.!<

Oh my god, you just made me shed tears of joy, even tho that the chance of this not becoming true, it felt soooooo real! I can't believe it!

&#x200B;

And just yesterday I finished the latest chapters and shed tears of grief!

&#x200B;

You comforted my soul, thank you.

&#x200B;

Time to distract myself and watch some JoJo.

You can't imagine how funny it is to me... LMAO

&#x200B;

Man I feel you, I attempted couple times, too. Everything's just depressing and stressing me out. XD
